.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_ASYM_CIPHER-RSA 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_ASYM_CIPHER-RSA
.Nd RSA Asymmetric Cipher algorithm support
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Asymmetric Cipher support for the
.Sy RSA
key type.
.Ss RSA Asymmetric Cipher parameters
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqpad-mode" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_PAD_MODE Ns ) <UTF8 string>
The default provider understands these RSA padding modes in string form:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqnone" ( Ns Sy OSSL_PKEY_RSA_PAD_MODE_NONE )
.It \(dqoaep" ( Ns Sy OSSL_PKEY_RSA_PAD_MODE_OAEP )
.It \(dqpkcs1" ( Ns Sy OSSL_PKEY_RSA_PAD_MODE_PKCSV15 )
This padding mode is no longer supported by the FIPS provider for key
agreement and key transport.
(This is a FIPS 140-3 requirement).
See
.Xr openssl-fipsinstall 1
.Sy -rsa_pkcs15_pad_disabled .
.It \(dqx931" ( Ns Sy OSSL_PKEY_RSA_PAD_MODE_X931 )
.El
.It \(dqpad-mode" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_PAD_MODE Ns ) <integer>
The default provider understands these RSA padding modes in integer
form:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It 1 ( Ns Sy RSA_PKCS1_PADDING )
This padding mode is no longer supported by the FIPS provider for key
agreement and key transport.
(This is a FIPS 140-3 requirement)
.It 3 ( Ns Sy RSA_NO_PADDING )
.It 4 ( Ns Sy RSA_PKCS1_OAEP_PADDING )
.It 5 ( Ns Sy RSA_X931_PADDING )
.El
See
.Xr EVP_PKEY_CTX_set_rsa_padding 3
for further details.
.It \(dqdigest" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_OAEP_DIGEST Ns ) <UTF8 string>
.It \(dqdigest-props" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_OAEP_DIGEST_PROPS Ns ) <UTF8 string>
.It \(dqmgf1-digest" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_MGF1_DIGEST Ns ) <UTF8 string>
.It \(dqmgf1-digest-props" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_MGF1_DIGEST_PROPS Ns ) <UTF8 string>
.It \(dqoaep-label" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_OAEP_LABEL Ns ) <octet string>
.It \(dqtls-client-version" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_TLS_CLIENT_VERSION Ns ) <unsigned integer>
See
.Sy RSA_PKCS1_WITH_TLS_PADDING
on the page
.Xr EVP_PKEY_CTX_set_rsa_padding 3 .
.It \(dqtls-negotiated-version" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_TLS_CLIENT_VERSION Ns ) <unsigned integer>
See
.Sy RSA_PKCS1_WITH_TLS_PADDING
on the page
.Xr EVP_PKEY_CTX_set_rsa_padding 3 .
.Pp
See
.Xr provider-asym_cipher 7
for more information.
.El
.Pp
The OpenSSL FIPS provider also supports the following parameters:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqfips-indicator" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_FIPS_APPROVED_INDICATOR Ns ) <integer>
.It \(dqkey-check" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_FIPS_KEY_CHECK Ns ) <integer>
See
.Xr provider-asym_cipher 7
for more information.
.It \(dqpkcs15-pad-disabled" ( Ns Sy OSSL_ASYM_CIPHER_PARAM_FIPS_RSA_PKCS15_PAD_DISABLED Ns ) <integer>
The default value of 1 causes an error during encryption if the RSA
padding mode is set to "pkcs1". Setting this to zero will ignore the
error and set the approved "fips-indicator" to 0. This option breaks
FIPS compliance if it causes the approved "fips-indicator" to return 0.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr EVP_PKEY-RSA 7 ,
.Xr EVP_PKEY 3 ,
.Xr provider-asym_cipher 7 ,
.Xr provider-keymgmt 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-default 7
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-FIPS 7
